WEBVTT

00:15:29.005 --> 00:15:30.290
Maka, saya ingin bertanya:

00:15:30.314 --> 00:15:31.796
siapa Newt Anda?

00:15:31.820 --> 00:15:32.997
Siapa Koch Anda?

00:15:33.021 --> 00:15:35.125
Siapa tentara militer di kisah Anda?

00:15:35.872 --> 00:15:37.489
Dan saya ingin Anda menemukan --

00:15:37.513 --> 00:15:40.034
memilih titik temu itu.

00:15:40.058 --> 00:15:41.261
Terima kasih.

00:15:41.285 --> 00:15:44.801
(Tepuk tangan) (Sorakan)